    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laba bazinhloko zezindlu, isizukulwana salabo abasuka lami eBabiloni ngesikhathi sokubusa kukaAtakisekisi inkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumadodana kaFiniyasi uGerishomu. Kumadodana kaIthamari uDaniyeli. Kumadodana kaDavida uHathushi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "indodana kaShekaniya. Kumadodana kaParoshi uZekariya owayebalwe kanye labantu abalikhulu lamatshumi amahlanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumadodana kaPahathi‐Mowabi uEliyowenayi, indodana kaZerahiya, owayelabantu abangamakhulu amabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumadodana kaZathu uShekaniya, indodana kaJahaziyeli, owayelabantu abangamakhulu amathathu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumadodana kaAdini uEbedi, indodana kaJonathani, owayelabantu abangamatshumi amahlanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumadodana kaElamu uJeshaya, indodana kaAthaliya, owayelabantu abangamatshumi ayisikhombisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumadodana kaShefathiya uZebadiya, indodana kaMikayeli, owayelabantu abangamatshumi aficaminwembili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumadodana kaJowabi uObadiya, indodana kaJehiyeli, owayelabantu abangamakhulu amabili letshumi lesificaminwembili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumadodana kaBani uShelomithi, indodana kaJosifiya, owayelabantu abalikhulu lamatshumi ayisithupha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumadodana kaBebayi uZekariya, indodana kaBebayi, owayelabantu abangamatshumi amabili lesificaminwembili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumadodana kaAzigadi uJohanani, indodana kaHakatani, owayelabantu abalikhulu letshumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumadodana kaAdonikamu, labo abafika muva amabizo abo ayengoElifeleti loJewuweli loShemaya, ababelabantu abangamatshumi ayisithupha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumadodana kaBigivayi uUthayi loZabudi ababelabantu abangamatshumi ayisikhombisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngababuthanisa ngasemfuleni oya eAhava, samisa khona insuku ezintathu. Ekuhloleni kwami abantu labapristi kangifumananga loyedwa wamaLevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasengibiza oEliyezeri loAriyeli loShemaya loElinathani loJaribi loElinathani loNathani loZekariya loMeshulamu, ababengamadoda amakhulu, loJoyaribi loElinathani ababengamadoda, aqedisisayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngabathumela kuIdo, umuntu omkhulu waseKasifiya, ngabatshela lokho ababezakutsho kuye lakuzihlobo zakhe, inceku zasethempelini ezivela eKasifiya, ukuba basithumele izikhonzi zendlu kaNkulunkulu wethu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngomusa kaNkulunkulu wethu esasilawo basithumela uSherebiya umuntu ohlakaniphileyo emadodaneni kaMahli kaLevi kaIsrayeli ekanye lamadodana akhe lezihlobo zakhe, belitshumi labantu abaficaminwembili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kanye loHashabiya eloJeshaya owamadodana kaMerari lezihlobo zakhe lamadodana akhe bengamatshumi amabili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kanye lezinceku zasethempelini ezingamakhulu amabili lamatshumi amabili uDavida lezinduna zakhe ababezahlukanisele ukusebenzela amaLevi. Bonke babizwa ngamabizo abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasengimemezela ukuzila ukudla khona ngasemfuleni iAhava ukuba sizithobe phambi kukaNkulunkulu wethu, sizicelele kuye indlela eqondileyo thina labantwana bethu lazo zonke impahla zethu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba ngaba lenhloni ukucela enkosini ibutho labagadi bamabhiza ukusivikela ezitheni ekuhambeni kwethu; ngoba sasiyitshelile inkosi sathi: UNkulunkulu wethu ulabo bonke abamdingayo, lamandla lolaka lwakhe lumelana labo bonke abamdelayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke sazila ukudla, samcela uNkulunkulu wethu ukusivikela ekuhambeni kwethu; wezwa ukucela kwethu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasengikhetha abapristi abayizikhulu abalitshumi lambili oSherebiya loHashabiya, lezihlobo zabo ezilitshumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngabalinganisela isiliva legolide lezitsha, okwakungumnikelo wendlu kaNkulunkulu wethu, okwakunikelwe yinkosi lezikhulu leziphathamandla zayo labakoIsrayeli bonke ababelapho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngalinganisa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " esiliva angamakhulu ayisithupha lamatshumi amahlanu, ngabanika, kanye lezitsha zesiliva ezilingene ikhulu lamathalenta, lamathalenta egolide alikhulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lemiganu yegolide engamatshumi amabili elingene inhlamvu eziyinkulungwane, lezitsha ezimbili zethusi elikhazimulayo eliligugu njengegolide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngathi kibo: Lina lahlukaniselwe iNkosi kanye lezitsha lezi; isiliva legolide kungumnikelo wesihle eNkosini, uNkulunkulu wabokhokho benu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulondolozeni likugcine lize likuqhubele abapristi abayizikhulu lamaLevi lezinhloko zezindlu zakoIsrayeli eJerusalema phakathi kwezindlu zethempeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abapristi lamaLevi basebethatha isiliva legolide lezitsha, bakusa eJerusalema, endlini kaNkulunkulu wethu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
