            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasukake ngasemfuleni iAhava ngosuku lwetshumi lambili lwenyanga yokuqala, saya eJerusalema. UNkulunkulu wethu wayelathi, wasivikela ekuhlaselweni yizitha lakulabo abasicathamelayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Safika eJerusalema, sahlala khona insuku ezintathu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngosuku lwesine, phakathi kwendlu kaNkulunkulu wethu, isiliva legolide lezitsha kwaqhutshezwa kuMeremothi umpristi indodana kaUriya eloEleyazare indodana kaFiniyasi kanye lamaLevi, oJozabadi indodana kaJeshuwa, loNowadiya indodana kaBinuwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konke kwabalwa kwalinganiswa, ubunzima bakho konke balotshwa ezingwalweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalesosikhathi labo ababebuyile ekuthunjweni banikela, kwaba ngumnikelo wokutshiswa kuNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, inkunzi ezilitshumi lambili zinikelelwa uIsrayeli wonke, lezinqama ezingamatshumi aficamunwemunye lesithupha, lamawundlu angamatshumi ayisikhombisa lesikhombisa; banikela lempongo ezilitshumi lambili, zaba ngumnikelo wesono; konke lokhu kwaba ngumnikelo wokutshiselwa iNkosi uNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banikeza lezimemezelo zenkosi kuzikhulu zenkosi lakubabusi belizwe elingaphetsheya komfula iYufrathi; bona basiza abantu lendlu kaNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
